---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Free webinar — find, fund and flip co-living properties"
  description="A live session for experienced flippers moving into co-living: underwriting by the room, funding the project, and who the finished house sells to."
  bare
>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Live webinar for fix and flippers</span>
      <h1>Find, fund, and flip co‑living properties.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Brian and Gina Kingdeski walk through the strategy, the systems, and the resources behind the Green Light Buying Machine — and how experienced flippers put an existing crew to work converting houses into co‑living properties.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn" href="#register">Save my seat</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/how-it-works">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="when">
      <dl>
        <dt>Date</dt>
        <dd>Tuesday, September 29</dd>
        <dt>Time</dt>
        <dd>2:00 PM
          <span class="tz">Arizona time — same clock as Pacific in September</span>
        </dd>
        <dt>Where</dt>
        <dd>Online, live
          <span class="tz">Join link is emailed after you register</span>
        </dd>
        <dt>Cost</dt>
        <dd>Free to attend</dd>
      </dl>
      <p class="count" id="count" hidden></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="band">
  <div class="wrap covered">
    <div>
      <h3>The co‑living model itself</h3>
      <p>What a purpose‑built co‑living conversion is, how it differs from the flip you already know, and why the room count changes the math.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Underwriting by the room</h3>
      <p>How room‑level rents are used to underwrite a property before you buy it, rather than pricing the house off comparable sales alone.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Funding the project</h3>
      <p>The financing routes operators use on these conversions, including lenders who work on both the acquisition and the buyer side.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Who the house sells to</h3>
      <p>Where the finished property goes, who the registered buyers are, and what has to be documented along the way for it to qualify.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>This one is worth your time if you already run flips</h2>
    <p>It is built for operators with a track record — roughly ten to fifteen completed flips, a crew that already works for you, and your own capital and financing. Nothing here is a starting point for a first deal.</p>

    <div class="ready">
      <div>
        <h3>Find the right deals</h3>
        <p>How to source properties with the layout and lot to support a co‑living conversion.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Renovate with confidence</h3>
        <p>The remodel standard we build to: a minimum of eight bedrooms and two bathrooms, with ensuites where room rents support them.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Fund your projects</h3>
        <p>Financing options and hard money strategies for conversions specifically, not generic flip lending.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Work alongside other operators</h3>
        <p>Access to the vendor, lender, and contractor network other members are already using.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Get certified as a builder</h3>
        <p>What documentation the certification requires and how a certified build gets listed to registered buyers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="signup" id="register">
  <div class="wrap signup-grid">
    <div>
      <h2>Don’t just flip houses. Build a co‑living legacy.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Register and we’ll send the join link straight away, plus a reminder the morning of the webinar.</p>
      <p class="fine">Seats are live and limited by the room, and the session isn’t always replayed. If you can’t make September 29, register anyway and we’ll let you know when the next one is scheduled.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <form id="webinarForm" novalidate>
        <div class="row">
          <div>
            <label for="w-first">First name</label>
            <input id="w-first" name="firstName" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" required>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="w-last">Last name</label>
            <input id="w-last" name="lastName" type="text" autocomplete="family-name" required>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
          <div>
            <label for="w-email">Email</label>
            <input id="w-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="w-phone">Mobile phone</label>
            <input id="w-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
          <div>
            <label for="w-city">City</label>
            <input id="w-city" name="city" type="text" autocomplete="address-level2" required>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="w-state">State</label>
            <input id="w-state" name="state" type="text" autocomplete="address-level1" required>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="w-flips">Flips you’ve completed</label>
          <select id="w-flips" name="flipsCompleted" required>
            <option value="">Select one</option>
            <option>None yet</option>
            <option>1–4</option>
            <option>5–9</option>
            <option>10–15</option>
            <option>More than 15</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="w-goal">What do you want to walk away with? <span style="font-weight:400;opacity:.65">(optional)</span></label>
          <textarea id="w-goal" name="goal" rows="3"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
          <label for="w-company">Company</label>
          <input id="w-company" name="company" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        </div>

        <input type="hidden" name="source" value="webinar-2026-09-29">

        <button class="btn" type="submit">Register for the webinar</button>
        <p class="fine formnote" id="formnote">By registering you agree to receive email and text messages about this webinar and the Green Light Buying Machine. Reply STOP to opt out at any time.</p>
      </form>

      <div class="msg" id="ok" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <h3>You’re registered.</h3>
        <p>The join link is on its way to the email address you gave us. If it hasn’t landed in a few minutes, check the spam folder, then email <a href="mailto:info@greenlightbuyingmachine.com">info@greenlightbuyingmachine.com</a>.</p>
        <p>Put it on your calendar so it doesn’t get away from you:</p>
        <button class="btn" type="button" id="ics">Add to calendar</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

  <script src="../scripts/webinar.js"></script>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
.nav{background:var(--ink-deep);color:var(--paper);
  box-shadow:inset 0 -1px 0 var(--rule)}
  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
.hero{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);
  padding-block:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,4.5rem)}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;gap:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.25rem);
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,.85fr);align-items:start}
  .hero p{opacity:.9}
  .when{border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:2px;
  padding:1.25rem 1.35rem;background:rgba(85,200,120,.05)}
  .when dl{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;
  gap:.35rem 1rem;align-items:baseline}
  .when dt{font-family:"Spline Sans Mono",monospace;font-size:.76rem;
  letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.6}
  .when dd{margin:0;font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem}
  .when .tz{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:.86rem;opacity:.72;
  font-family:Literata,serif}
  .count{margin-top:1.1rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);
  font-family:"Spline Sans Mono",monospace;font-size:.9rem;opacity:.85}
  .count b{color:var(--signal-bright);font-weight:500}
  /* ---------- buttons ---------- */
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--signal);color:var(--ink-deep);
  font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;letter-spacing:.01em;
  padding:.8rem 1.5rem;border:0;border-radius:2px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;
  transition:background .15s ease}
  /* ---------- covered ---------- */
.band{background:var(--ink-soft);color:var(--paper)}
  .covered{display:grid;gap:1.6rem 2.25rem;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(15rem,1fr));
  padding-block:clamp(2.25rem,4vw,3.25rem)}
  .covered h3{color:var(--signal-bright);margin-bottom:.3rem}
  .covered p{font-size:.96rem;opacity:.86;margin:0}
  section{padding-block:clamp(2.75rem,5vw,4rem)}
  .ready{display:grid;gap:1.5rem 2rem;margin-top:2rem;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(14rem,1fr))}
  .ready div{border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:.85rem}
  .ready h3{margin-bottom:.25rem}
  .ready p{font-size:.95rem;opacity:.78;margin:0}
  /* ---------- form ---------- */
.signup{background:var(--ink-deep);color:var(--paper)}
  .signup .wrap{padding-block:clamp(2.75rem,5vw,4rem)}
  .signup-grid{display:grid;gap:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,3rem);
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.9fr) minmax(0,1.1fr);align-items:start}
  .signup h2{color:var(--paper)}
  .signup .lede{opacity:.85}
  form{display:grid;gap:.9rem}
  .row{display:grid;gap:.9rem;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  label{display:block;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;
  margin-bottom:.3rem}
  input,select,textarea{width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:.98rem;
  padding:.62rem .7rem;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);
  border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:2px}
  input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,
.btn:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-bright);
  outline-offset:2px}
  textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:4.5rem}
  .formnote{margin:.4rem 0 0}
  .err{color:#FFC9C0}
  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
footer{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);
  padding-block:clamp(2.25rem,4vw,3rem)}
  .hero-grid,.signup-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  *{transition:none !important;animation:none !important}
  @media (max-width:820px){
  .hero-grid,.signup-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  h1{max-width:none}
}
</style>
